OL,3,GNEWSACouple died of injuries in M1
OL,4,Acrash, inquest finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young Sheffield couple with "the rest
OL,7,Fof their lives to look forward to" died
OL,8,Fin a high-speed collision on the M1 on
OL,9,Fthe way home from a meal, an inquest
OL,10,Fhas heard.
OL,12,FUmar Akhbar, 23, was driving at speed
OL,13,Fon 13 November with Aiza Nageen, 24, in
OL,14,Fthe front passenger seat when he lost
OL,15,Fcontrol of the car near Barnsley and
OL,16,Fveered across three lanes of the
OL,17,Fmotorway and the hard shoulder before
OL,18,Fhitting a tree, the inquest in
OL,19,FSheffield heard.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
