OL,3,GNEWSACouple died of injuries in M1
OL,4,Acrash, inquest finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssistant Sheffield coroner Hannah
OL,7,FBerry ruled the couple's deaths were
OL,8,Fdue to injuries caused in the
OL,9,Fcollision.
OL,11,FIn a tribute, Nageen's sister Aisha
OL,12,Fspoke of her close bond with her
OL,13,Fsister, saying she was "one in a
OL,14,Fmillion" and "remarkably wise beyond
OL,15,Fher years".
